ithub.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤンキー組は控え室で待ってたんだけどね、\n皆んなで、いろんなグループのTOPの人が集まったみたいだね‥‥って話をしました(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに。。。\nでも個性的すぎるよね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかったから良かった（＾∇＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭にアメちゃん入れて遊んだりした～( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい思い出っ（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>> ☆*:.｡. o(≧▽≦)o .｡.:*☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロちゃんさんがライブ来てくれたんだけどね、とってもhappyな気分になりましたっ♪───Ｏ（≧∇≦）Ｏ────"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますこれからもこうして見てくださる方がいるかぎり、 まだまだ未熟者ですがまあやは全力で頑張っていきたいですっ（＾∇＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆*:.｡. o(≧▽≦)o .｡.:*☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しをちょっとしようかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？きゅんとしたことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！ん～あっ！学校にその日はリボンじゃなくてネクタイで行ったのね！？\nそしたら友達が\nまあやネクタイ曲がってるよ！\nっていって無言で直してくれたの！そんで最後に\nほんとまあやは私がいないと何もできないよね！\nって言われて不覚にも女の子にキュンとした！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？今なにが食べたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか食いしん坊キャラがみんなにばれてきてるなぁ‥‥‥＞_＜笑\n目の前になんかあったらなんでも食べるよっ( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はパフェ食べたいっ(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？ファンからもらって嬉しかったものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでもめっちゃ嬉しいけど、特に手紙や、メッセージとか、後は日常で使えるものもうれしいかなぁ～服とかレッスン着、鞄とかキャップその人の顔を思い出しながら 照 笑\nテンション上がっちゃう(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？得意料理は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オムライス～( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？握手会、女の子にはどんな髪型にしてもらいたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～とねぇまあやはポニーテールかぁストレートでなにもしてないのとか好きぃ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？どの季節が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの季節もほんとにすきなんだけどぉ、どれか！って言われたら秋かなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物もおいしいし、気温も涼しいくらいだからちょうどいい^_^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！今日はここまでっ( ^ω^ )質問沢山ありがとねっ！また今度返します(^o^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> あっ！みんな親の結婚記念日祝ってくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両親も喜んでましたっ（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛犬のポテト"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね！ずっとくっついてきてね、ずっとなめてくんのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいすぎ‥‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！さっきね、電話帳から友達を出そうと思ったら無意識にネット検索のとこに名前打ってて自分ってばかだなぁ‥‥って思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない！？みんなそーゆーこと！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生まあや握手会情報だとご好評らしくて‥‥第二弾を行おうと思うのですがどうですかねぇ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/28/5668398/0020.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}